OL,3,GNEWSACould mustard factory plan unlock
OL,4,Acity's past?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRegenerating Colman's former mustard
OL,7,Ffactory in Norwich could transform a
OL,8,Fcorner of the city - and uncover
OL,9,Fhistory currently hidden from view.
OL,11,FPlans are due to be lodged for the
OL,12,Ffirst phase of the Carrow Works
OL,13,Fdevelopment, which includes building
OL,14,F300 homes.
OL,16,FThe sprawling 42-acre site was an
OL,17,Findustrial hub, but there are also
OL,18,Fmedieval ruins and listed buildings
OL,19,Fwithin it that are rarely seen by the
OL,20,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
